          "docs": "Returns a list of *Coupons*. Default sorting is by coupon/discount id, from lowest to highest. You can pass in optional filter parameters. We recommended using `?min_id=x&limit=y` to paginate through a large set of data because it offers better performance.\n\n## Usage Notes\n\nAvailable types for `type` and `exclude_type` filters:\n\n|Type|\n|-|\n|`per_item_discount`|\n|`percentage_discount`|\n|`per_total_discount`|\n|`shipping_discount`|\n|`free_shipping`|\n|`promotion`|\n\nCoupons with `type=promotion` will"
        },
        {
