          },
          "docs": "Creates a *Coupon*.\n\n**Required Fields**\n*   `name`\n*   `code`\n*   `type`\n*   `amount`\n*   `applies_to`\n\n**Read Only Fields**\n*   `id`\n*   `num_uses`\n\n**Notes**\n\nThe coupon type can be one of the following:\n\n*   `per_item_discount`\n*   `per_total_discount`\n*   `shipping_discount`\n*   `free_shipping`\n*   `percentage_discount`\n\nLegacy coupon codes only work with the store's default currency. Applying a coupon with any other currency other than the store's default will result in the error: \"Coupons"
        },
